  "prefLabel": "Lab 303.17 Wrap up Policy",
  "priorExpiration": "2007-01-11",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 303.17 “Wrap up Policy” means a workers compensation insurance policy written by a carrier to cover a short term project that covers the general contractor and all subcontractors or the specific worksite. These policies are also known as “an ‘Owner Controlled Insurance Policy’ (OCIP)”.\n\nSource. #6806, eff 7-18-98 (formerly Lab 303.15); ss by #8682, INTERIM, eff 7-15-06, EXPIRED: 1-11-07\n\nNew. #9019, eff 11-1-07; ss by #11065, eff 4-1-16",
